        <item>
            <title>0.17.5</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 12:49:46 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://agentseye.app/</link>
            <sparkle:version>53</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.17.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[AgentsEye 0.17.5 tightens local data protection. The analytics database,
write-ahead log, and shared-memory files now use owner-only permissions, and
the app repairs permissions on existing local data when it opens the database.

Discord webhook validation now rejects embedded credentials and nonstandard
ports. No prompts, responses, credentials, or webhook URLs are added to app
telemetry or diagnostics.
]]></description>
